 حول الفتى الطموح مونكي دي لوفي، الذي أكل بالخطأ \"فاكهة شيطان\" منحت جسده خصائص المطاط مقابل خسارته القدرة على السباحة. ينطلق لوفي إلى البحر مدفوعاً بالعثور على الكنز والتتويج بلقب ملك القراصنة. خلال رحلته في المحيط الأكثر خطورة، \"الجراند لاين\"، يقوم لوفي بجمع طاقم مميز ومتنوع يُعرف باسم \"طاقم قبعة القش\"، يضم سيافاً بارعاً، وملاحة ذكية، وطباخاً ماهراً، وغيرهم من الأصدقاء الذين يملك كل منهم حلماً خاصاً يسعى لتحقيقه.","coverImage":"https://pub-008f58d8b06a469e9f801809cbb653ed.r2.dev/manga/90a69c73-7adf-4f51-9344-2ce469c40e11/cover.jpg","bannerImage":"https://pub-008f58d8b06a469e9f801809cbb653ed.r2.dev/manga/90a69c73-7adf-4f51-9344-2ce469c40e11/banner.webp","attachmentUrl":null,"author":"ٌْْإيتشيرو أودا","status":"ONGOING","isFeatured":false,"releaseYear":1997,"views":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-20T11:02:58.923Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-20T11:02:58.923Z","genres":[],"chapters":[{"number":1,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T11:10:29.248Z"},{"number":2,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T11:17:59.854Z"},{"number":3,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T11:32:08.844Z"},{"number":4,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T11:35:43.044Z"},{"number":5,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T12:26:02.982Z"},{"number":6,"publishedAt":"2026-05-20T12:36:30.873Z"},{"number":1184,"publishedAt":"2026-05-28T09:58:38.455Z"},{"number":1185,"publishedAt":"2026-06-11T12:55:04.210Z"}],"ratings":[{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":6},{"value":10},{"value":1},{"value":10},{"value":8},{"value":10},{"value":1},{"value":10},{"value":9},{"value":10}]},{"id":"50221497-6ae5-45bd-8a8b-b02cf8c97acb","slug":"boruto-two-blue-vortex-english","title":"Boruto: Two Blue Vortex ENGLISH","description":"The story follows Boruto as he tries to survive being hunted by the Hidden Leaf, uncover the truth behind the altered reality, and stop a growing threat involving evolved Divine Trees and the remaining members of the Ōtsutsuki-related conflict. Compared to the earlier part of Boruto, Two Blue Vortex has a darker tone, heavier emotional stakes, stronger focus on mystery and destiny, and more intense large-scale battles.","coverImage":"https://pub-008f58d8b06a469e9f801809cbb653ed.r2.dev/manga/50221497-6ae5-45bd-8a8b-b02cf8c97acb/cover.jpg","bannerImage":"https://pub-008f58d8b06a469e9f801809cbb653ed.r2.dev/manga/50221497-6ae5-45bd-8a8b-b02cf8c97acb/banner.jpeg","attachmentUrl":null,"author":"Masashi Kishimoto / Mikio Ikemoto","status":"ONGOING","isFeatured":false,"releaseYear":2023,"views":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-19T17:59:05.838Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-19T17:59:05.838Z","genres":[],"chapters":[{"number":34,"publishedAt":"2026-05-19T18:01:30.202Z"},{"number":33,"publishedAt":"2026-05-19T18:23:47.503Z"},{"number":32,"publishedAt":"2026-05-19T18:26:22.608Z"}],"ratings":[{"value":10},{"value":10},{"value":9},{"value":10}]}],"page":1,"limit":30,"total":7}